en</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Yellow_augments\" title=\"Category:Yellow augments\">Yellow</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Eminence_of_Winter\" title=\"Named item sets\">Eminence of Winter</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Eminence_of_Winter\" title=\"Named item sets\">Eminence of Winter</a>:</b> <span style=\"text-align:left;\"><ul><li>2 Pieces Equipped: +30 Artifact bonus to Physical Resistance Rating</li><li>3 Pieces Equipped: +30 Artifact bonus to Healing, Repair, and Negative Amplification</li><li>4 Pieces Equipped: +10% Legendary bonus to maximum hitpoints</li><li>5 Pieces Equipped: +100% Artifact bonus to Threat Generation</li><li>6 Pieces Equipped: +3 Artifact bonus to Constitution</li><li>7 Pieces Equipped: +15% Artifact bonus to Armor Class</li></ul></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Armor Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Armor Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Chainmail_of_the_First_Snow.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Chainmail_of_the_First_Snow.png/420px-Chainmail_of_the_First_Snow.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"783\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Chainmail_of_the_First_Snow.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i><a href=\"/page/Feytwisted\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feytwisted\"><span style=\"color:#f09\">F</span><span style=\"color:#f00\">E</span><span style=\"color:#f90\">Y</span><span style=\"color:#cf0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#3f0\">W</span><span style=\"color:#0f6\">I</span><span style=\"color:#0ff\">S</span><span style=\"color:#06f\">T</span><span style=\"color:#30f\">E</span><span style=\"color:#c0f\">D</span></a> Armor<br /><br />This light chainmail is speckled with gold and other precious metals. It carries warmth despite the thin cloth material. Some part of its contruction brings memories of industry, of silt and rain and the bustle of civilization. It smells of ozone and smoke and broken dreams. Was this made by a Sharn artificer, someone you've met on your travels? Or is this a memory of travels yet to come?</i>\n</td></tr>\n<